{"3101980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Friends' Kitchen", "steam_appid": 3101980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends’ Kitchen</strong> is a fast-paced cooking and serving game for 1–4 players. Prepare dishes in the right order, manage your kitchen flow, overcome silly accidents (burning pans, slippery floors, clumsy collisions!), and deliver plates right on time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Players:</strong> Dive into the kitchen chaos solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Required:</strong> Split the roles — chopping, cooking, plating, serving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Chaos:</strong> Every stage adds new layouts, hazards, and funny surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Recipes:</strong> Pizza and more, with endless ingredient combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Replayable:</strong> 8–12 minute rounds that beg for “just one more game”.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laughter Guaranteed:</strong> Friendly rivalry and hilarious fails will test friendships.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/1e5286598c9d1f9797e369c74ae93bba.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span><strong>TEAM UP!</strong><br>Gather your friends for the ultimate culinary adventure! In Friends' Kitchen, success depends on your crew. Bring together your best team of big-headed chefs and sharp-dressed waiters to conquer the most challenging kitchens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/3703b9fb774aeceb82f90c168f65654e.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAN YOUR STRATEGY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kitchen needs a plan. Assign roles, map out your workflow, and optimize your movements. Strategic planning is the key to surviving the levels of increasing difficulty in each theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/cc005cef9b74beb46f520cdb45601877.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span><strong>COOPERATE!</strong><br>Communication is your secret ingredient! Coordinate every move, from passing ingredients to washing dishes. Work in perfect harmony to ensure every plate leaves the kitchen in top-tier style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/01bce6e176e722c3c43fd643f14edbba.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span><strong>RACE AGAINST TIME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking! Keep your eyes on the timer and your hands on the pans. Deliver orders quickly to keep your customers happy and earn those high-score bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/44fa634847441f3143671cda856bdde5.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KITCHEN CHAOS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourselves for high-energy madness! When orders fly in and ingredients start tossing, only the fastest survive. Experience the hilarious, fast-paced tempo that makes every level a wild ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍳 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check the Orders:</strong> Watch the order screen to see which ingredients are needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Ingredients:</strong> Prepare dough, sauce, etc, in the right order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop &amp; Cook:</strong> Slice ingredients, throw them into the oven or onto the stove.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plate &amp; Serve:</strong> Move the finished dish onto a plate and deliver it on time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the Chaos:</strong> Burning pans, slippery floors, and collisions… react fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Points:</strong> Serve quickly and accurately to hit the highest scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: This game may cause laughter and friendly rivalry!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends’ Kitchen</strong> is a fast-paced cooking and serving game for 1–4 players. Prepare dishes in the right order, manage your kitchen flow, overcome silly accidents (burning pans, slippery floors, clumsy collisions!), and deliver plates right on time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Players:</strong> Dive into the kitchen chaos solo or with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork Required:</strong> Split the roles — chopping, cooking, plating, serving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rising Chaos:</strong> Every stage adds new layouts, hazards, and funny surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Recipes:</strong> Pizza and more, with endless ingredient combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short &amp; Replayable:</strong> 8–12 minute rounds that beg for “just one more game”.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laughter Guaranteed:</strong> Friendly rivalry and hilarious fails will test friendships.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/1e5286598c9d1f9797e369c74ae93bba.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span><strong>TEAM UP!</strong><br>Gather your friends for the ultimate culinary adventure! In Friends' Kitchen, success depends on your crew. Bring together your best team of big-headed chefs and sharp-dressed waiters to conquer the most challenging kitchens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/3703b9fb774aeceb82f90c168f65654e.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAN YOUR STRATEGY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kitchen needs a plan. Assign roles, map out your workflow, and optimize your movements. Strategic planning is the key to surviving the levels of increasing difficulty in each theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/cc005cef9b74beb46f520cdb45601877.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span><strong>COOPERATE!</strong><br>Communication is your secret ingredient! Coordinate every move, from passing ingredients to washing dishes. Work in perfect harmony to ensure every plate leaves the kitchen in top-tier style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/01bce6e176e722c3c43fd643f14edbba.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span><strong>RACE AGAINST TIME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking! Keep your eyes on the timer and your hands on the pans. Deliver orders quickly to keep your customers happy and earn those high-score bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/extras/44fa634847441f3143671cda856bdde5.avif?t=1778870674\" width=864 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KITCHEN CHAOS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourselves for high-energy madness! When orders fly in and ingredients start tossing, only the fastest survive. Experience the hilarious, fast-paced tempo that makes every level a wild ride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🍳 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Check the Orders:</strong> Watch the order screen to see which ingredients are needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Ingredients:</strong> Prepare dough, sauce, etc, in the right order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chop &amp; Cook:</strong> Slice ingredients, throw them into the oven or onto the stove.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plate &amp; Serve:</strong> Move the finished dish onto a plate and deliver it on time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the Chaos:</strong> Burning pans, slippery floors, and collisions… react fast!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Points:</strong> Serve quickly and accurately to hit the highest scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: This game may cause laughter and friendly rivalry!</i></p>", "short_description": "Cook up chaos and serve laughter! Friends’ Kitchen is a fast-paced co-op kitchen game for 1–4 players: prepare, cook, and race against the clock!", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101980/729